===Format===
* '''Group Stage:'''
** Two double round-robin format groups
*** Each group has three teams
*** All teams play each other twice
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo2}}
** The top team from each group advances to the Playoffs

* '''Playoffs:''' 
** Single-Elimination bracket
** All matches ''(excl. Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** The Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}}

